#: ../../api-reference.md:3
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Référence de l’API"

#: ../../api-reference.md:5
msgid ""
"This page is generated from the OpenAPI file, which is exported from the "
"service code. When the API changes, this page changes with it."
msgstr ""
"Cette page est générée à partir du fichier OpenAPI, qui est exporté depuis "
"le code du service. Lorsque l’API change, cette page est également mise à jour."

#: ../../api-reference.md:7
msgid ""
"All endpoints except `/health` need an API key. See "
"[Authentication](authentication.md)."
msgstr ""
"Tous les endpoints, à l’exception de `/health`, nécessitent une clé API. "
"Voir [Authentification](authentication.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:9
msgid "POST /v1/generate"
msgstr "POST /v1/generate"

#: ../../api-reference.md:11
msgid "**Generate text**"
msgstr "**Générer du texte**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:13
msgid ""
"Sends a prompt to a model and returns the response. The response includes"
" an X-Data-Region header that echoes the region that processed the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Envoie un prompt à un modèle et renvoie la réponse. La réponse inclut un "
"en-tête X-Data-Region qui indique la région ayant traité la requête."

#: ../../api-reference.md:15 ../../api-reference.md:74
#: ../../api-reference.md:104
msgid "Requires an API key."
msgstr "Nécessite une clé API."

#: ../../api-reference.md:17 ../../api-reference.md:106
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "Corps de la requête"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Champ"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Obligatoire"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Oui"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "ID of the model to use. List them with GET /v1/models."
msgstr "ID du modèle à utiliser. Listez-les avec GET /v1/models."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt`"
msgstr "`prompt`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The text you want the model to respond to. Length 1 to 4000 characters."
msgstr ""
"Le texte auquel vous souhaitez que le modèle réponde. Longueur comprise "
"entre 1 et 4000 caractères."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Non"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Language code of the prompt. Each model supports a different set. "
"Default: `\"en\"`."
msgstr ""
"Code de langue du prompt. Chaque modèle prend en charge un ensemble différent. "
"Par défaut : `\"en\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "integer"
msgstr "integer"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Upper limit on tokens in the response. Cannot exceed the model's "
"max_output_tokens. Default: `64`. Minimum 1."
msgstr ""
"Limite maximale de tokens dans la réponse. Ne peut pas dépasser "
"`max_output_tokens` du modèle. Par défaut : `64`. Minimum : 1."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`region`"
msgstr "`region`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Where the request is processed: ke, ug, ma or mu. Default: `\"ke\"`."
msgstr ""
"Région dans laquelle la requête est traitée : ke, ug, ma ou mu. "
"Par défaut : `\"ke\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:27 ../../api-reference.md:112
msgid "Example request body:"
msgstr "Exemple de corps de requête :"

#: ../../api-reference.md:39 ../../api-reference.md:76
#: ../../api-reference.md:120 ../../api-reference.md:145
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Réponses"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Signification"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "200"
msgstr "200"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text and token usage."
msgstr "Le texte généré et l’utilisation des tokens."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The request was invalid. Check the message field."
msgstr "La requête est invalide. Vérifiez le champ message."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The API key is missing or not valid."
msgstr "La clé API est absente ou invalide."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model or endpoint does not exist."
msgstr "Le modèle ou l’endpoint n’existe pas."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Rate limit exceeded. Wait for the number of seconds in the Retry-After "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Limite de requêtes dépassée. Attendez le nombre de secondes indiqué dans "
"l’en-tête Retry-After."

#: ../../api-reference.md:49 ../../api-reference.md:84
#: ../../api-reference.md:129 ../../api-reference.md:151
msgid "A `200` response has these fields."
msgstr "Une réponse `200` contient les champs suivants."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Unique ID for this generation."
msgstr "ID unique pour cette génération."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Le modèle qui a traité la requête."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The language code you sent."
msgstr "Le code de langue que vous avez envoyé."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Le texte généré."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string, one of `stop`, `length`"
msgstr "string, l’une des valeurs `stop`, `length`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"stop means the response ended naturally. length means it was cut off at "
"max_tokens."
msgstr ""
"`stop` signifie que la réponse s’est terminée naturellement. `length` "
"signifie qu’elle a été interrompue à `max_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Usage object"
msgstr "Objet d’utilisation"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Token counts for this request."
msgstr "Nombre de tokens pour cette requête."

#: ../../api-reference.md:60
msgid "The `usage` object has these fields."
msgstr "L’objet `usage` contient les champs suivants."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt_tokens`"
msgstr "`prompt_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the prompt."
msgstr "Tokens dans le prompt."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`completion_tokens`"
msgstr "`completion_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the response."
msgstr "Tokens dans la réponse."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`total_tokens`"
msgstr "`total_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "prompt_tokens plus completion_tokens."
msgstr "`prompt_tokens` plus `completion_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:68 ../../api-reference.md:98
#: ../../api-reference.md:137
msgid "Failures use the standard error body described in [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les erreurs utilisent le corps d’erreur standard décrit dans "
"[Erreurs](errors.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:70
msgid "GET /v1/models"
msgstr "GET /v1/models"

#: ../../api-reference.md:72
msgid "**List models**"
msgstr "**Lister les modèles**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The models you can use."
msgstr "Les modèles que vous pouvez utiliser."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of ModelInfo object"
msgstr "tableau d’objets ModelInfo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The available models."
msgstr "Les modèles disponibles."

#: ../../api-reference.md:90
msgid "Each item in `data` has these fields."
msgstr "Chaque élément de `data` contient les champs suivants."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Model ID. Pass this as model when you generate text."
msgstr "ID du modèle. Transmettez-le comme `model` lorsque vous générez du texte."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_output_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_output_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Largest max_tokens value this model accepts."
msgstr "Valeur maximale de `max_tokens` acceptée par ce modèle."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`languages`"
msgstr "`languages`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of string"
msgstr "tableau de chaînes"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Language codes this model accepts."
msgstr "Codes de langue acceptés par ce modèle."

#: ../../api-reference.md:100
msgid "POST /v1/tokens/count"
msgstr "POST /v1/tokens/count"

#: ../../api-reference.md:102
msgid "**Count tokens**"
msgstr "**Compter les tokens**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Text to count tokens for. Length 1 to 20000 characters."
msgstr ""
"Texte dont il faut compter les tokens. Longueur comprise entre 1 et 20000 "
"caractères."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The token count for the text."
msgstr "Le nombre de tokens du texte."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Nombre de tokens dans le texte."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of words in the text, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Nombre de mots dans le texte, séparés selon les espaces."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "token_count divided by word_count, rounded to two decimals."
msgstr "`token_count` divisé par `word_count`, arrondi à deux décimales."

#: ../../api-reference.md:139
msgid "GET /health"
msgstr "GET /health"

#: ../../api-reference.md:141
msgid "**Check service health**"
msgstr "**Vérifier l’état du service**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:143
msgid "No API key needed."
msgstr "Aucune clé API n’est nécessaire."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The service is running."
msgstr "Le service est opérationnel."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`status`"
msgstr "`status`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Always ok when the service is running."
msgstr "Toujours `ok` lorsque le service est opérationnel."